Short:        Unit for KickPascal/MaxonPascal3 for fontsensitive GUIs
Author:       Björn Schotte <bjoern@bomber.mayn.de>
Type:         dev/src
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This unit, called OS2-Unit, is a unit for easier programming
GadTools-Gadgets... It offers a lot of functions, e.g.
fontsensitive Routines, drawing a fontsensitive BevelBox/BevelLine,
Setting a ListView-Gadget, ghosting gadgets, setting MX-Gadgets
etc...

It is very powerful and easy to use!

OS2Unit is GIFTWARE and ©1995,96 by Björn Schotte. The author
isn't reliable for any damage this unit makes!!
